Write the vector $\underset{\sim}{v}$ shown below in component form.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.55]
\usetikzlibrary{arrows.meta}
\draw[step=1,gray!25,very thin] (-6,-5) grid (2,2);
\draw[->] (-6.4,0)--(2.4,0) node[right]{$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-5.4)--(0,2.4) node[above]{$y$};
\foreach \i in {-2,-4,-6} \node[above,font=\scriptsize] at (\i,0){$\i$};
\foreach \i in {-2,-4} \node[right,font=\scriptsize] at (0,\i){$\i$};
\draw[-{Stealth},thick,blue] (0,0)--(-5,-4) node[below left]{$\underset{\sim}{v}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
